# 基础词 Unit 09 短语

## 常考短语

- **under control**: 在控制中 — The situation is now under control. 局势现在已在控制之中。
- **out of control**: 失控 — The fire got out of control. 火势失控了。
- **a matter of controversy**: 有争议的问题 — The topic is a matter of controversy. 这个话题是有争议的。
- **it is convenient for sb to do sth**: 某人做某事很方便 — It is convenient for us to meet here. 我们在这里见面很方便。
- **convince sb of sth**: 使某人相信某事 — She convinced him of her sincerity. 她使他相信了她的诚意。
- **cooperate with**: 与…合作 — The team cooperated with other departments. 团队与其他部门合作。
- **cope with**: 应对 — She learned to cope with pressure. 她学会了应对压力。
- **at the core of**: 在…的核心 — Honesty is at the core of any good relationship. 诚实是任何良好关系的核心。
- **correspond with**: 与…一致 — The results correspond with our expectations. 结果与我们的预期一致。
- **take courage**: 鼓起勇气 — It takes courage to admit your mistakes. 承认错误需要勇气。
- **give credit to**: 归功于 — We should give credit to the team. 我们应该把功劳归于团队。
- **a crime against**: 对…的犯罪 — Pollution is a crime against nature. 污染是对自然的犯罪。
- **in crisis**: 处于危机中 — The economy is in crisis. 经济处于危机中。
- **be critical of**: 对…持批评态度 — She is critical of the government's policy. 她对政府的政策持批评态度。
- **out of curiosity**: 出于好奇 — She opened the box out of curiosity. 她出于好奇打开了盒子。
